• 2D Pixel Sprites & UI Prompts: Kenney.nl (Tiny Dungeon, Tiny Town, RPG Urban Pack, Input Prompts) — CC0 1.0 Public Domain
• 4-Dir Pixel Character Base: OpenGameArt CC0 Walk Cycles & 3/4 Directional Sprite Sets — CC0 1.0 Public Domain
• SFX Audio: Kenney RPG Audio, Impact Sounds, Interface Sounds & Freesound CC0 Contributors — CC0 1.0 Public Domain
• UI / GUI (tombol, panel, bar, dialog, slot, ikon): dobo_ui — 'Fantasy RPG UI Pack' versi DEMO (https://dobo-ui.itch.io/fantasy-rpg-ui-pack)
• BGM Music: Kevin MacLeod (incompetech.com) 'Teller of the Tales', 'Suonatore di Liuto', 'Evening Fall (Harp)' — CC-BY 4.0"

